 "notes": "Contents on pdf pp2-11 (two columns, 'number TITLE' in caps), OCRed at 300 dpi with autocontrast; faint scan, so many numbers were misread (dropped/added digits) and were repaired against their neighbours (book is in alphabetical order with ~1 tune per page). Printed page = pdf page up to about printed 320, then pdf = printed - 2 (two printed pages missing around 321-323; pdf 404 prints 406). pdfPage was then refined by OCRing the top of every page (pdf 12-459) and fuzzy-matching the title within +-2 of the expected page: conf high = title found on that page and index number agreed; med = either the title matched but the index number needed repair, or no title match (page OCR of the caps title often fails, or two tunes on one page); low = repaired number and no title match. Spot check by viewing the top of 24 random pages: about 16 matched exactly, the rest were off by 1-2 pages or a continuation page (e.g. El Dia Que Me Quieras listed at 144 is on the page after El Cumbanchero; Cat Talk is 84 not 83; Meditation is 273). So expect page errors of +-1-2 for conf med/low entries. Accents are lost in titles (OCR); some titles have OCR slips. Added 'A Esa' (pdf 12) by looking at the page; index line was lost. Entries are not de-duplicated across tunes listed with the same page.",
